{"title":"Career Roadmap · Cognitive Systems Developer","role":"Cognitive Systems Developer","summary":"A Cognitive Systems Developer designs and develops software that can perceive information, understand human inputs, reason over data, learn from interactions, and support decision-making.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Tech / B.E. — Engineering & Technology","Course":"Human-Computer Interaction / Cognitive Computing"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Cognitive Systems Developer designs and develops software that can perceive information, understand human inputs, reason over data, learn from interactions, and support decision-making."},{"type":"p","text":"The role sits at the intersection of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Artificial Intelligence"},{"text":"Machine Learning"},{"text":"Human-Computer Interaction (HCI)"},{"text":"Natural Language Processing (NLP)"},{"text":"Computer Vision"},{"text":"Cognitive science"},{"text":"Data engineering"},{"text":"Software engineering"},{"text":"Conversational AI"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Typical responsibilities include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Building intelligent user-facing systems"},{"text":"Developing conversational and multimodal interfaces"},{"text":"Integrating ML models into applications"},{"text":"Designing human-AI interaction workflows"},{"text":"Working with NLP, recommendation, vision, or reasoning systems"},{"text":"Evaluating model performance and user experience"},{"text":"Building AI-assisted decision-support applications"},{"text":"Developing prototypes using LLMs and AI APIs"},{"text":"Studying user behavior and interaction patterns"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Horizon","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["B.Tech / B.E.","AI / HCI Intern","Cognitive Systems Developer","AI/ML Engineer / Conversational AI Engineer","Senior AI Engineer / Cognitive Computing Engineer","AI Systems Architect / Hum